@startuml
!include style.puml
title GitHub Actions checks (.github/workflows/ci.yml)

start
:Trigger: pull request (any branch), push to master / dev,
weekly schedule (audit), manual dispatch;
note right
  permissions: contents: read
  no repository secrets
  actions pinned to full commit SHAs
  Node.js from .nvmrc
end note
fork
  :lint
  npm run lint;
fork again
  :typecheck
  npm run typecheck;
fork again
  :unit-tests
  npm test (Vitest);
fork again
  :db-integration
  postgres:17 service container
  npm run test:integration;
fork again
  :e2e-role-journeys
  disposable PostgreSQL + Chromium
  npm run test:e2e;
fork again
  :build
  npm run build (no env vars);
fork again
  :secret-scan
  gitleaks (checksum-verified)
  over full history;
fork again
  :dependency-audit
  npm audit --audit-level=high;
end fork
:Branch protection (set by a human) requires the checks
and a reviewed pull request before merging;
stop
@enduml
